name: sim.isObjectInSelection
description: 
luaSynopsis: int selectionState=sim.isObjectInSelection(int objectHandle)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. objectHandle: handle of the object
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. 3 if object is the last selection,1 if object is in selection, 0 if not, -1 if operation was not successful
